## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite
- **Short description:** Google’s Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite is a stable, low-latency, cost-effective multimodal model optimized for high-volume/lightweight tasks with 1M input context.
- **Provider / access:** Google AI Studio / Gemini API (`gemini-3.1-flash-lite`). Local metadata lists `google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite`, notes AI Studio free tier and no verified OpenCode Console route.
- **Release / knowledge:** Gemini API docs reviewed 2026-11-10 (latest update May 2026 per docs). API shutdown scheduled for 2027-05-07 per local metadata.
- **IDs:** `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 input tokens; 65,536 output tokens (Gemini API docs).
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video, audio, and PDF input; text output (Gemini API docs).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Paid standard pricing referenced in docs (local metadata cites $0.25/M text/image/video input, $0.50/M audio input, $1.50/M output); AI Studio free tier available per metadata.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary Google model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

